@startuml Offline Request State Machine
!theme plain
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FEFECE
  BorderColor #A80036
}

title Offline Request Queue State Machine

[*] --> Pending : Request queued\n(device offline)

Pending --> InProgress : Connectivity restored,\nsync starts
Pending --> Pending : Retry count < max\n(after failure)

InProgress --> Completed : Server responds\n2xx success
InProgress --> Failed : Server error\nor network failure

Failed --> InProgress : Retry\n(retry_count < max)
Failed --> Pending : Max retries reached,\nwait for next sync

Completed --> [*]
Pending --> [*] : Max retries exceeded\n(give up)

note right of Pending : Stored in\noffline_requests table.\nMethod, path, body saved.
note right of InProgress : Request being\nreplayed to server.
note right of Completed : Successfully synced.\nReady for cleanup.
note right of Failed : Error message stored.\nRetry with backoff.

@enduml

@startuml Story Lifecycle State Machine
!theme plain
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FEFECE
  BorderColor #A80036
}

title Story Lifecycle State Machine

[*] --> Draft : Contributor creates story

Draft --> Pending : Submit for review
Draft --> Archived : Delete draft

Pending --> Published : Admin/Manager approves
Pending --> Rejected : Admin/Manager rejects
Pending --> Archived : Admin archives

Published --> Archived : Admin archives
Published --> Rejected : Flagged & removed

Rejected --> Draft : Author revises
Rejected --> Archived : Admin archives

Archived --> Draft : Restore (admin)

note right of Draft : Story is being written.\nOnly visible to author.
note right of Pending : Awaiting moderation.\nVisible to managers/admins.
note right of Published : Live on platform.\nVisible to all users.
note right of Rejected : Failed review.\nAuthor can revise.
note right of Archived : Hidden from public.\nCan be restored.

note right of Pending
  GAP: pending -> published happens only
  in the Django admin site; no approve/
  reject API endpoint.
end note

@enduml

