@startuml Media Job State Machine
!theme plain
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FEFECE
  BorderColor #A80036
}

title AI Video/Audio Job State Machine

[*] --> Pending : Job submitted

Pending --> Processing : External API starts\nprocessing
Pending --> Failed : API error or\nvalidation failure

Processing --> Completed : Generation\nfinished successfully
Processing --> Failed : API error or\ntimeout

Failed --> Pending : User retries

Completed --> [*]

note right of Pending : Job queued.\nWaiting for external\nAPI to pick up.
note right of Processing : Luma AI / TTS\nactively generating.\nProgress updating.
note right of Completed : Video URL / Audio URL\navailable for playback.
note right of Failed : Error message stored.\nUser can retry.

@enduml

